whisper: Lesson 5: Lists
whisper:
whisper: A list keeps a bunch of values in order. You can add to it, ask how big it is,
whisper: and go through it with "for each". Counting starts at 1, not 0, the way people count.
whisper:
whisper: Your turn: add two more things to the shopping, then say the last one.
whisper: (Hint: "item 3 of shopping" is the third. "the size of shopping" is how many there are.)

genesis:
  set shopping to a list of ("milk", "eggs")
  add "bread" to shopping
  scrawl "I need ", the size of shopping, " things: ", shopping
  for each thing in shopping:
    scrawl "- ", thing
  if shopping contains "eggs": scrawl "Don't drop the eggs!"
and the universe said i love you
